From: juanan <juanan@test.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 21:32:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] T7: add PHPUnit tests of the IED extension

- Shared helper (tests/ied_test_helper.php); the upstream generator and
  tests are not modified.
- Tests for weights, ranges, final grade calculation, academic
  validation and its event, numeric grading, rendering, backup and
  restore, privacy, and the upstream behaviour with every feature off.
- Document how to run the suite and the known upstream issue: the grader
  side panel tests error on Moodle 4.5 (MDL-76583, externallib requires
  process isolation); they are out of scope and unchanged since 2aece39.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
